--------------------------------
glu_backward_cuda_out
来源: aten/src/ATen/native/cuda/Activation.cpp
--------------------------------

【签名】
    glu_backward_cuda_out(
        grad_output: Tensor[*D, dim=M],
        input: Tensor[*D, dim=N],
        dim: int,
        grad_input: Tensor[*D, dim=N]
    ) -> Tensor[*D, dim=N]

    约束:
    - input.dim() > 0
    - N % 2 == 0 (dim维度必须是偶数)
    - M == N / 2

【算法】
    wrap_dim = maybe_wrap_dim(dim, input.dim())
    nIn = input.size(wrap_dim)
    dim_size = nIn / 2

    resize_output(grad_input, input.sizes())

    # 构建迭代形状 (将dim维度减半)
    iter_shape = input.sizes()
    iter_shape[wrap_dim] = dim_size

    # 配置迭代器
    iter = TensorIteratorConfig()
        .add_output(grad_input)
        .add_const_input(input)
        .add_const_input(grad_output)
        .resize_outputs(false)
        .declare_static_shape(iter_shape)
        .build()

    if iter.numel() == 0:
        return grad_input

    # 计算跨步
    I_stride = input.strides()[wrap_dim] * dim_size
    gI_stride = grad_input.strides()[wrap_dim] * dim_size

    # 启动kernel
    if iter.can_use_32bit_indexing():
        launch_glu_backward_kernel(iter, gI_stride, I_stride)
    else:
        for sub_iter in iter.with_32bit_indexing():
            launch_glu_backward_kernel(sub_iter, gI_stride, I_stride)

    return grad_input

【并行模式】
    通过 TensorIterator 并行，处理减半后的维度形状
    kernel 内部使用 I_stride 和 gI_stride 访问前后两半数据

【备注】
    - GLU (Gated Linear Unit) 将输入沿dim分成两半: [a, b]
    - 前向: output = a * sigmoid(b)
    - 后向: 需要计算对完整input的梯度
    - launch_glu_backward_kernel: 实际的CUDA kernel，见 Activation.h

--------------------------------
glu_backward_cuda
来源: aten/src/ATen/native/cuda/Activation.cpp
--------------------------------

【签名】
    glu_backward_cuda(
        grad_output: Tensor[*D, dim=M],
        input: Tensor[*D, dim=N],
        dim: int
    ) -> Tensor[*D, dim=N]

【算法】
    grad_input = at::empty({0}, input.options())
    return glu_backward_cuda_out(grad_output, input, dim, grad_input)

--------------------------------
log_sigmoid_forward_out_cuda
来源: aten/src/ATen/native/cuda/Activation.cpp
--------------------------------

【签名】
    log_sigmoid_forward_out_cuda(
        input: Tensor[*D],
        result: Tensor[*D],
        buffer: Tensor
    ) -> (Tensor[*D], Tensor)

【算法】
    iter = TensorIteratorConfig()
        .add_output(result)
        .add_const_input(input)
        .build()

    launch_log_sigmoid_forward_kernel(iter)

    return (result, buffer)

【并行模式】
    elementwise (通过 TensorIterator)

【备注】
    - buffer 参数仅用于CPU实现，CUDA版本忽略
    - log_sigmoid(x) = log(sigmoid(x)) = log(1 / (1 + exp(-x)))
    - launch_log_sigmoid_forward_kernel: 实际的CUDA kernel，见 Activation.h

--------------------------------
log_sigmoid_forward_cuda
来源: aten/src/ATen/native/cuda/Activation.cpp
--------------------------------

【签名】
    log_sigmoid_forward_cuda(input: Tensor[*D]) -> (Tensor[*D], Tensor)

【算法】
    result = at::empty_like(input)
    buffer = at::empty({0}, input.options())
    return log_sigmoid_forward_out_cuda(input, result, buffer)

