--------------------------------
内核声明 (Activation.h)
来源: aten/src/ATen/native/cuda/Activation.h
--------------------------------

【函数】
    launch_glu_backward_kernel(
        iter: TensorIteratorBase,
        gI_stride: int64,
        I_stride: int64
    )
        用途: 启动GLU反向传播CUDA kernel

    launch_log_sigmoid_forward_kernel(iter: TensorIteratorBase)
        用途: 启动log_sigmoid前向CUDA kernel

    GeluCUDAKernelImpl(it: TensorIteratorBase, approximate: GeluType)
        用途: 启动GELU前向CUDA kernel

    GeluBackwardCUDAKernelImpl(it: TensorIteratorBase, approximate: GeluType)
        用途: 启动GELU反向传播CUDA kernel
